5,1,1,talk,Daisuke,,I... I think we should look at the misrouted deliveries in the incident logs and the time lost to copying existing records. I want to see the actual daily losses.,"{""words"":30,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
6,1,1,talk,May,,"That's a bit gloomy, Daisuke! I'm more worried about who's actually doing the work. I'll check the staffing of the coordination group and in-house developer availability.","{""words"":26,""mentions"":[""Daisuke""],""raw_differs"":false}"
7,1,1,talk,Shunichi,,I'll take a more pragmatic route. I'm interested in the network coverage at customer plants and the handling of vendor queries. Let's see what we actually control.,"{""words"":27,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
8,1,1,talk,Ryuji,,"I believe we must be cautious about the financial commitments. I will examine the capital budget and software allowance, and vendor licence pricing versus fixed-fee work.","{""words"":26,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
9,1,1,talk,Kenji,,I want to know what worked before! I'll look into the outcomes of the last three internal rollouts and the record of cross-unit standardization efforts.,"{""words"":25,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
